DirkuLator 0.5.20: submit queued operations/query work before the GPU thread idles.
Idle fences explicitly wait for host-GPU completion, including when caches have no downloads.
No rendering work or tensor shaders are skipped. Existing non-idle fence behavior is unchanged.
EDEN_NX2_IDLE_FENCE_OFF restores the pre-layer idle behavior.

